  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India-Norway Marine Spatial Planning Collaboration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Environment Agency supports the Government of India (National Centre for Coastal Research - NCCR) in developing Marine Spatial Plans.The overall objective of the project is to contribute towards improved ecological status of marine and coastal ecosystems in India, which again will lead to a strengthened Blue Economy and increased human well-being.</narrative>
  </description>
